-- `T WITHAL` on a record imported from another module, one of whose fields
-- has no default: the error names that field (TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md
-- T1, ruled by Meng 2026-10-09). The defaults cross the IMPORT, so
-- `quantity` is not named and `item` is.
IMPORT `withal-import-missing-def`

GIVETH AN Order
bad MEANS Order WITHAL
